<title>USA: Trump Hotels &amp; Casino Q1 net shr loss $0.59.</title>
<headline>Trump Hotels &amp; Casino Q1 net shr loss $0.59.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trump Hotels &amp; Casino Resorts Inc</p>
<p>		     Consolidated Statements of Operations</p>
<p>				     (Unaudited)</p>
<p>			 (In thousands, except share data)</p>
<p>							     3 Months</p>
<p>						    3/31/97	 3/31/96</p>
<p> Net Revenues				    343,380	 82,868</p>
<p> Net Loss					   13,944	(9,864)</p>
<p> Weighted Average # Shares		23,524,052   10,133,333</p>
<p> Loss Per Share				   (0.59)	 (0.97)</p>
<p> Loss Per Share Assuming Conversion	 (0.59)	 (0.59)</p>
<p>Loss per share is based upon 23,524,052 shares and 10,133,333 weighted average shares outstanding for the first quarter ended March 31, 1997 and 1996, respectively.</p>
<p>The last figure assumes  the conversion of Donald J. Trump's interest into l3,918,723 shares for the first quarter 1997 and 6,666,667 shares for 1996.</p>
